{
	"about": "The values contract of save_draft_card, written once for both sides. Each case: `sealed` is the sealed call's values (create) or changes (update): one child table `rows` plus maybe a top-level field. `values` is what the form sends; `written` is what the server must hand to the write (create_doc values / update_doc changes). The server test (jarvis/tests/test_draft_card_edit.py) runs edited_call(sealed, values) and expects `written`; the app test (draftCardValues.spec.js) builds the form from `sealed` (+ `savedRows` on an update, the record's stored rows), replays `form`, and expects the payload to equal `values`. `form` ops: {op: set, row, cell, value}, {op: remove, row}, {op: insert, row, cells}, {op: append, cells}; `row` is the position in the form's list at that moment. `side: server` marks a case the form cannot produce (see `why`). The table columns the app builds: item, qty (Float), note, and so_detail (read-only: the form shows it and never sends it).",
	"cases": [
		{
			"id": "create-kept-row-one-edited-cell",
			"verb": "create",
			"sealed": { "title": "T", "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1 }, { "item": "B", "qty": 2 }] },
			"form": [{ "op": "set", "row": 1, "cell": "qty", "value": "5" }],
			"values": { "rows": [{ "_draft_row": 0 }, { "_draft_row": 1, "qty": 5 }] },
			"written": { "title": "T", "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1 }, { "item": "B", "qty": 5 }] }
		},
		{
			"id": "create-inserted-row-in-the-middle",
			"verb": "create",
			"sealed": { "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1 }, { "item": "B", "qty": 2 }] },
			"form": [{ "op": "insert", "row": 1, "cells": { "item": "N" } }],
			"values": { "rows": [{ "_draft_row": 0 }, { "item": "N" }, { "_draft_row": 1 }] },
			"written": { "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1 }, { "item": "N" }, { "item": "B", "qty": 2 }] }
		},
		{
			"id": "create-row-removed",
			"verb": "create",
			"sealed": { "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1 }, { "item": "B", "qty": 2 }] },
			"form": [{ "op": "remove", "row": 0 }],
			"values": { "rows": [{ "_draft_row": 1 }] },
			"written": { "rows": [{ "item": "B", "qty": 2 }] }
		},
		{
			"id": "create-cell-emptied",
			"verb": "create",
			"sealed": { "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1, "note": "x" }] },
			"form": [{ "op": "set", "row": 0, "cell": "note", "value": "" }],
			"values": { "rows": [{ "_draft_row": 0, "note": "" }] },
			"written": { "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1 }] }
		},
		{
			"id": "create-nothing-edited",
			"verb": "create",
			"sealed": { "title": "T", "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1 }] },
			"form": [],
			"values": {},
			"written": { "title": "T", "rows": [{ "item": "A", "qty": 1 }] }
		},
		{
